  "prefLabel": "Agr 1405.22 Liquid Measuring Devices; Form Liq.other",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Agr 1405.22 Liquid Measuring Devices; Form Liq.other. Service technicians shall complete and submit to the division the “Placed in Service/Inspection Report Liq. Form” other when installing, servicing, repairing, reconditioning, or performing annual testing of commercial devices for which there is no specifically designated placed in service/inspection report form available.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes #1 and #2 at chapter heading for Agr 1400) #12424, eff 12-1-17",
